        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "@echasnovski I have been looking forward to this for a quite some time. Many colour schemes are too colourful for me (when it comes to highlighting). I like it a bit more stripped down, so I will try to recreate my favourite ones. The `n_hues` option is naturally a big win for me. Thanks for creating another useful plugin! 🙂",
