        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the feedback!\r\n\r\n> The `n_hues` option is naturally a big win for me. Thanks for creating another useful plugin! slightly_smiling_face\r\n\r\nBeware that it will only replace non-base colors and not remove them. So it it will be less like a rainbow but still colored (like in a video demo). For anything more involved I'd recommend checking 'mini.colors' (like filtering out colors within certain hue ranges).\r\n\r\nThis is mostly because I also prefer using more colors for more information. But, of course, not too much. I found that 8 hues were just enough (original attempt with 6 did not allow describe all needed information).",
