        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "This is awesome! `randomhue` is my main colour scheme now ☺️ I notice though that by default the `StatusLine` highlight looks almost like the `Normal`. Is it intentional? I would like to suggest using the same background as `StatusLineNC`, and change the foreground colour instead to something with higher contrast 🙏\r\n\r\nI'm also thinking of submitting a PR with values for `hl-User1..9`, but I would like to know if you agree that changing only the foreground makes sense.\r\n\r\nRegardless, this is a great plug-in, and it motivated me to try the other modules in the repo. Thanks so much for it!",
